<title>USA: D&amp;P may upgrade Renaissance unit rating.</title>
<headline>D&amp;P may upgrade Renaissance unit rating.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it placed the Triple B Minus rating of RHG Finance Corp, a special-purpose finance subsidiary of Renaissance Hotel Group N.V., on rating watch for a possible upgrade.</p>
<p>The action follows Marriott International Inc's announcement that it will acquire RHG in a cash transaction valued at about $1 billion.</p>
<p>Because RHG Finance's $120 million of senior guaranteed notes due 2005 are unconditionally guaranteed by RHG, the rating directly reflects the general creditworthiness of RHG, D&amp;P said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
